{"duration": 27.03, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.12, "text": "Taking only the liver may also protect\nthe orca's teeth. Shark skin is covered in"}, {"start": 5.12, "end": 11.66, "text": "tiny scales shaped like teeth, and it\nfeels like sandpaper. Orcas that eat a lot"}, {"start": 11.66, "end": 18.52, "text": "of shark wear their teeth down flat. Since\n1969, three dead orcas with flat-worn"}, {"start": 18.52, "end": 23.19, "text": "teeth and shark remains in their\nstomachs have washed up in South Africa."}, {"start": 23.89, "end": 27.03, "text": "Port and Starboard seem to\nbelong to this shark-eating type."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.32, "text": "Taking"}, {"start": 0.32, "end": 0.74, "text": "only"}, {"start": 0.74, "end": 0.94, "text": "the"}, {"start": 0.94, "end": 1.26, "text": "liver"}, {"start": 1.26, "end": 1.48, "text": "may"}, {"start": 1.48, "end": 1.84, "text": "also"}, {"start": 1.84, "end": 2.26, "text": "protect"}, {"start": 2.26, "end": 2.5, "text": "the"}, {"start": 2.5, "end": 2.96, "text": "orca's"}, {"start": 2.96, "end": 3.3, "text": "teeth."}, {"start": 4.04, "end": 4.14, "text": "Shark"}, {"start": 4.14, "end": 4.42, "text": "skin"}, {"start": 4.42, "end": 4.6, "text": "is"}, {"start": 4.6, "end": 4.88, "text": "covered"}, {"start": 4.88, "end": 5.12, "text": "in"}, {"start": 5.12, "end": 5.46, "text": "tiny"}, {"start": 5.46, "end": 5.9, "text": "scales"}, {"start": 5.9, "end": 6.18, "text": "shaped"}, {"start": 6.18, "end": 6.42, "text": "like"}, {"start": 6.42, "end": 6.84, "text": "teeth,"}, {"start": 7.32, "end": 7.72, "text": "and"}, {"start": 7.72, "end": 8.3, "text": "it"}, {"start": 8.3, "end": 8.66, "text": "feels"}, {"start": 8.66, "end": 9.0, "text": "like"}, {"start": 9.0, "end": 9.92, "text": "sandpaper."}, {"start": 10.56, "end": 10.82, "text": "Orcas"}, {"start": 10.82, "end": 11.04, "text": "that"}, {"start": 11.04, "end": 11.24, "text": "eat"}, {"start": 11.24, "end": 11.38, "text": "a"}, {"start": 11.38, "end